### 로그인한 유저 카드 등록
### 1) 로그인 실행 → 응답의 user.id 확인 후 @creatorUserId 에 넣기, Set-Cookie의 token 값을 @token 에 넣기
### 2) "카드 등록" 요청 실행 (Cookie 필요)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@contentType = application/json
@token =
@creatorUserId = 5

###

### 로그인
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test0202@naver.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### 카드 등록 (multipart, 이미지 없이)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/photo-cards
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="creatorUserId"

{{creatorUserId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

피카츄
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="genre"

앨범
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="grade"

common
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="totalSupply"

5
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

로그인 유저 카드 등록 테스트
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="minPrice"

10000
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

### 카드 등록 (이미지 파일 포함 시)
### name="file"; filename="이미지파일경로" 아래에 실제 파일 경로 지정 (예: < ./test.jpg)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/photo-cards
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="creatorUserId"

{{creatorUserId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="name"

잠만보
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="genre"

동물
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="grade"

rare
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="totalSupply"

3
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

이미지 포함 등록
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="minPrice"

15000
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./test.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
